                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospitalisation of your 71-year-old female patient, admitted on 02/06/2020 with an acute exacerbation of her known chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. On admission, she presented with increased dyspnoea, productive cough, and reduced oxygen saturation. Clinical examination, chest X-ray, arterial blood gas analysis, and pulse oximetry confirmed the exacerbation. Blood tests showed mild inflammatory markers. Spirometry supported severe underlying obstruction. She was treated with nebulised bronchodilators, systemic corticosteroids, supplemental oxygen therapy, and closely monitored vital signs throughout her stay. She responded well to treatment, with improvement in respiratory function and oxygenation. She was discharged on 03/06/2020 with an optimised inhaler regimen and appropriate patient education regarding her condition and action plan. Please arrange follow-up at your earliest convenience. Kind regards, Dr. [Treating Physician].</div>
               </text>
            </section>
